Hi,

Firezone now requires Entra users to sign in from a verified tenant, improving
your account's security.

For <%= @notice.name %>, these additional tenants need verification:
<%= for tenant <- @notice.tenants do %>
- <%= tenant.id %>
<% end %>
Go to Settings -> Authentication:
<%= @settings_url %>

Edit your Entra provider and click Verify another tenant for each tenant above.
Save to allow users from those tenants to sign in.

Questions? Reply to this email.
